        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Saved evidence and scope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Part B: data/processed/prepared_text.jsonl + data/week3_manifest.json&lt;br&gt;Part C: data/pipeline_v1/documents/ prepared export + pipeline_manifest.json + repeatability_report.json&lt;br&gt;Keep source licenses / NOTICES and the modification notice with derived text. Raw source files stay ignored.&lt;br&gt;Solid arrows: executed data flow. Dashed arrows: observed comparison informs the shared configuration.&lt;br&gt;No embeddings, vector index, model training, answer generation, deployment or full quality assessment in this lab." style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=18;fontSize=22;fillColor=#F5F7FA;strokeColor=#CBD5DF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
